<title>USA: REMEC approves 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>REMEC approves 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>REMEC Inc said Friday that its directors approved a three-for-two stock split of its common stock in the form of a 50 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The stock dividend is payable June 27 to shareholders of record June 20, 1997, the company said.</p>
<p>REMEC designs and makes modules for microwave transmission systems used in the defense and commercial wireless telecommunications markets.</p>
<p>It said the stock split will increase its outstanding shares of common stock to about 18,353,000 shares.</p>
